# BROWSER-restack.md - Substack Restack Patterns

## SS 10. Restack with a Note

🚨 **Radix UI dropdown:** Substack uses Radix UI for the Restack menu. MUST use `PointerEvent` sequence (`pointerdown` → `pointerup` → `click`).

🚨 **Two button shapes** — Notes: `button[aria-label="Restack"]` (URL-anchored picker — pick the button whose closest `/note/c-X` ancestor link matches the current note ID; fallback to all on feed/profile pages). Articles: `post-ufi-button` immediately after the Comments button. JS tries both, verifies the opened menu.

🚨 **Pre-clear with Escape before clicking.** Radix dropdowns toggle: a stale menu would close on click. Always dispatch `keydown Escape` first.

### Step 1 — Click Restack button and select "Restack with a note"

```bash
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { key: 'Escape', bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 500)); var candidates = []; var notesBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[aria-label=\"Restack\"]')); if (notesBtns.length > 0) { var noteIdMatch = window.location.pathname.match(/note\\/(c-\\d+)/); var noteId = noteIdMatch ? noteIdMatch[1] : null; if (noteId) { for (var bi = 0; bi < notesBtns.length; bi++) { var anc = notesBtns[bi]; for (var ai = 0; ai < 15; ai++) { if (!anc.parentElement) break; anc = anc.parentElement; var link = anc.querySelector ? anc.querySelector('a[href*=\"/note/c-\"]') : null; if (link) { var mm = (link.href || '').match(/note\\/(c-\\d+)/); if (mm && mm[1] === noteId) candidates.push(notesBtns[bi]); break; } } } } if (candidates.length === 0) { for (var nn = 0; nn < notesBtns.length; nn++) candidates.push(notesBtns[nn]); } } var ufiBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[class*=\"post-ufi-button\"]')).filter(function(b) { return b.getBoundingClientRect().width > 0; }); for (var j = 0; j < ufiBtns.length; j++) { var aria = ufiBtns[j].getAttribute('aria-label') || ''; if (/comments/i.test(aria) && ufiBtns[j + 1]) candidates.push(ufiBtns[j + 1]); } if (candidates.length === 0) return { error: 'no restack button candidates' }; for (var k = 0; k < candidates.length; k++) { var btn = candidates[k]; var rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect(); var cx = rect.x + rect.width / 2, cy = rect.y + rect.height / 2; btn.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerdown', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 50)); btn.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerup', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); btn.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1500)); var menuItems = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[role=\"menuitem\"]')); var quoteItem = menuItems.find(function(m) { return m.innerText.trim() === 'Restack with a note'; }); if (quoteItem) { quoteItem.click(); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000)); var editor = document.querySelector('div[contenteditable=\"true\"]'); return { opened: !!editor }; } document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { key: 'Escape', bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 300)); } return { error: 'no candidate opened restack menu', tried: candidates.length }; }"}
ENDJSON
```

### Step 2 — Type quote note and post

Use **BROWSER-note.md SS 9 Step 2** (identical Notes composer — contenteditable + "Post" button).

### When to Restack

Restack content aligned with your pillars with genuine {{role}} perspective. Skip off-topic, low-quality, self-restacks. Quote note: 1-3 sentences adding real value, not just "great post".
